.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/28/smurfit-westrock-sw-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/","lens":{"theater":[0,0,0,0.0],"cinema":[0,0,0,0.0],"imax":[0,0,0,0.0],"streaming":[0,0,0,0.0],"dtc":[0,0,0,0.0],"ai_spend":[0,0,0,0.0],"tariffs":[0,0,0,0.0],"pricing_power":[22,19,3,23.66],"cost_cuts":[1,1,0,1.07],"guidance":[0,0,0,0.0,{"raise":0,"reaffirm":0,"cut":0}],"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":0.0545,"r5":0.1205,"r1_spy":0.0584,"r5_spy":0.1276,"r1_sector":0.047,"r5_sector":0.0598,"etf":"XLY"}}],"quotes":[{"c":"SW 2024 Q2","e":"sw","d":"2024-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ken Bowles","x":"These results, another strong set should be seen in the right context, which is against the backdrop of higher input costs, particularly OCC, but also before the expected recovery of those inflow costs to box price increases.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SW 2024 Q2","e":"sw","d":"2024-07-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Anthony P. J. Smurfit","x":"And so clearly, with the paper price increases that are already in the market place on the assumption that nothing bad happens in the world, to say that seems to be the low point.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SW 2024 Q3","e":"sw","d":"2024-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ken Bowles","x":"But probably the moving parts around where creditors sit and falling prices around some of those creditor items versus investment in working capital as a result of box price increases are probably 2 big sides, but inventory tends to be in good shape.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SW 2024 Q3","e":"sw","d":"2024-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Anthony P. J. Smurfit","x":"For sure, we've seen many opportunities for growth and cost reduction.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SW 2024 Q3","e":"sw","d":"2024-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Anthony P. J. Smurfit","x":"But over the last period of time, the combination has radically improved as a result of these closures, significant cost savings have been achieved.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SW 2024 Q4","e":"sw","d":"2025-02-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tony Smurfit","x":"Obviously, the big buckets for risk are currency, tariffs, and energy.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SW 2024 Q4","e":"sw","d":"2025-02-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tony Smurfit","x":"We haven't had a question yet on tariffs, but I'm sure somebody will ask it shortly.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SW 2024 Q4","e":"sw","d":"2025-02-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tony Smurfit","x":"…on the market Philip whether it's Italy, it might be a bit less where in Germany it's a bit more and the central areas somewhere between €30 and €80 has been implemented during the month of February as well as kraftliner, which will be -- which we've announced a price increase for March.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SW 2024 Q4","e":"sw","d":"2025-02-12","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Philip Ng","x":"I noticed you and a handful of your peers have price increases in the marketplace for February and March.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SW 2024 Q4","e":"sw","d":"2025-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tony Smurfit","x":"We believe that by unleashing the power of our people, there are significant operating improvements through cost takeout, commercial approach and Quick Win CapExes to release greater profitability.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SW 2024 Q4","e":"sw","d":"2025-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tony Smurfit","x":"Of course, along the way with our model of decentralization and making accountability lie at the closest area it can to customers, it has been necessary to streamline the business.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SW 2025 Q1","e":"sw","d":"2025-05-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tony Smurfit","x":"And I think that comes back to the whole question of tariffs and uncertainty and getting some certainty in those – in that area for the consumer to feel good in the North American market.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SW 2025 Q1","e":"sw","d":"2025-05-01","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Tony Smurfit","x":"I'll take the easy one on tariffs.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SW 2025 Q1","e":"sw","d":"2025-05-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Tony Smurfit","x":"So we feel good about the European market and our positioning and the pass-through of the first price increase that's gone in.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SW 2025 Q1","e":"sw","d":"2025-05-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Charlie Muir-Sands","x":"And are you, for example, in Europe assuming that a second board price hike, which many have mooted but has not yet been recognized, is successful?","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SW 2025 Q1","e":"sw","d":"2025-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Tony Smurfit","x":"We remain excited about the number of opportunities we see to continually optimize our system for growth but also for cost takeout.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SW 2025 Q1","e":"sw","d":"2025-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ken Bowles","x":"We have taken significant actions to streamline the central functions of the segment and to continue to optimize and invest in the asset base.","url":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/kurry/sp500_earnings_transcripts"},{"c":"SW 2025 Q3","e":"sw","d":"2025-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Anthony P. J. Smurfit","x":"But with regard to how these AI data centers are affecting us, I haven't heard that they're driving any major cost increases for our mill systems where our mill systems are located.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/smurfit-westrock-sw-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SW 2025 Q3","e":"sw","d":"2025-10-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Anthony Pettinari","x":"You mentioned energy projects, and I mean from other industrial companies and paper companies, we've heard a lot about cost inflation and particularly electricity with demand from AI and data centers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/smurfit-westrock-sw-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SW 2025 Q3","e":"sw","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Anthony P. J. Smurfit","x":"I don't think tariff really comes into our thinking here.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/smurfit-westrock-sw-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SW 2025 Q3","e":"sw","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Anthony P. J. Smurfit","x":"And obviously, FBB against SBS with the tariff is making it more challenging.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/smurfit-westrock-sw-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SW 2025 Q3","e":"sw","d":"2025-10-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ken Bowles","x":"But I think it's fair to say that both regions have done really well in terms of pricing given the backdrop, I think particularly Europe in terms of price increases received and held, if you like, even through the third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/smurfit-westrock-sw-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SW 2025 Q3","e":"sw","d":"2025-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Anthony P. J. Smurfit","x":"In addition to changing our customer portfolio, we're also continuing to rightsize the business by closing down inefficient or loss-making operations including the recently announced closure of a corrugated facility in California in addition to the 8 previously announced closures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/smurfit-westrock-sw-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SW 2025 Q3","e":"sw","d":"2025-10-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Anthony P. J. Smurfit","x":"In our consumer business, this business is very well positioned with substantial investments and restructuring already done.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/04/smurfit-westrock-sw-q3-2025-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"SW 2026 Q2","e":"sw","d":"2026-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ken Bowles","x":"Selling price remained a headwind in the quarter due to a small pass-through impact of weaker containerboard index pricing in February and also coming before higher index pricing was realized in some of our paperboard grades, which came this month.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/smurfit-westrock-sw-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SW 2026 Q2","e":"sw","d":"2026-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Ken Bowles","x":"Phil, I think within there, I think I heard that the idea that the latest round of kind of price increases and the price environment might lead to incremental capacity entering the market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/smurfit-westrock-sw-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SW 2026 Q2","e":"sw","d":"2026-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Anthony P. J. Smurfit","x":"We're also relentless in our approach to cost takeout, which we have again demonstrated through asset optimization with a number of closures in both our North American and EMEA and APAC regions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/smurfit-westrock-sw-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SW 2026 Q2","e":"sw","d":"2026-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ken Bowles","x":"As profitability and returns improve, we believe we are well positioned to continue to invest behind growth and cost takeout opportunities while at the same time, increasing returns to shareholders.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/smurfit-westrock-sw-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SW 2026 Q3","e":"sw","d":"2026-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Anthony Paul J. Smurfit","x":"To counteract these cost increases, we have, by necessity, implemented price increases across most paper grades which are being passed on with the normal time lag.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/28/smurfit-westrock-sw-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SW 2026 Q3","e":"sw","d":"2026-10-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Anthony Paul J. Smurfit","x":"As in other regions, we have implemented paper price increases to recover costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/28/smurfit-westrock-sw-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"SW 2026 Q3","e":"sw","d":"2026-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Anthony Paul J. Smurfit","x":"By significant cost takeout initiatives and rationalization measures.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/28/smurfit-westrock-sw-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[58,1,8539,0,0,0,3523,4735],[59,1,9275,0,0,0,7525,1376],[60,1,10165,0,0,0,8331,1429],[61,1,10293,0,0,0,7752,2079],[63,1,10097,0,0,0,8342,1453],[66,1,9225,0,0,0,7170,1643],[67,1,9509,0,0,0,7440,1501]],"cinema":[[58,1,8539,0,0,0,3523,4735],[59,1,9275,0,0,0,7525,1376],[60,1,10165,0,0,0,8331,1429],[61,1,10293,0,0,0,7752,2079],[63,1,10097,0,0,0,8342,1453],[66,1,